Shaded artifact
---------------

target/agentic-flink-1.0.0-SNAPSHOT-uber.jar (the root pom.xml, maven-shade-plugin,
   classifier `uber`). The main artifact agentic-flink-1.0.0-SNAPSHOT.jar is thin and
   bundles nothing. The uber jar packs every compile-scope dependency of the Flink
   framework module, including the optional ones, together with their transitive closure.
   The shade configuration excludes org.apache.flink:flink-shaded-force-shading,
   com.google.code.findbugs:jsr305, org.slf4j:* and org.apache.logging.log4j:* (logging
   is provided by the Flink distribution at run time) and strips signature files.

